<div><x-feedback/><div class="admin-settings-grid"><section class="panel"><h2>Tetapan Paparan</h2><p>Pilihan ini disimpan untuk akaun anda sahaja.</p><form wire:submit="save" class="form-stack"><label>Mod Paparan<select wire:model="theme"><option value="light">Mod Cerah</option><option value="dark">Mod Gelap</option></select></label><label>Saiz Teks<select wire:model="text_size"><option value="normal">Biasa</option><option value="large">Besar</option></select></label><label class="admin-preference-toggle"><span><strong>Animasi</strong><small>Gerakan dan peralihan pada halaman Pentadbir.</small></span><input type="checkbox" wire:model="animations" role="switch" aria-label="Aktifkan animasi"></label><button class="btn btn-primary" wire:loading.attr="disabled" wire:target="save">Simpan Tetapan</button></form></section><section class="panel"><h2>Keselamatan</h2><h3>Tukar Kata Laluan</h3><p>Gunakan sekurang-kurangnya 8 aksara.</p><form wire:submit="changePassword" class="form-stack"><label>Kata Laluan Semasa<input wire:model="current_password" type="password" required autocomplete="current-password"></label><label>Kata Laluan Baharu<input wire:model="password" type="password" required minlength="8" autocomplete="new-password"></label><label>Sahkan Kata Laluan Baharu<input wire:model="password_confirmation" type="password" required autocomplete="new-password"></label><button class="btn btn-primary" wire:loading.attr="disabled" wire:target="changePassword">Kemas Kini Kata Laluan</button></form></section></div></div>
